  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Radius of bokeh (circle of confusion) is proportional to the reciprocal of F-stop.\nIt means that higher precision is required when F-stop is smaller.\nTherefore, I think that exponential mapping is better for the F-stop slider.\n```\nSteps in the current implementation:\n0.0      8.0      16       24       32\n |--------|--------|--------|--------|\nSteps in my proposal:\n1.0    2.0    4.0    8.0    16     32\n |------|------|------|------|------|\n```",
